  illustration: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 84509be7158e07f4f895b41aa9ca7254, type: 3}
  storyText: 'But one day, the World Core begins to crack. Its light becomes unstable,
    the ground shakes, and the sky changes color. The lands of Hopix start to lose
    balance, breaking apart and collapsing into chaos.


    Leo watches in horror
    as his homeland begins to fall apart. Everything that once felt safe and familiar
    suddenly becomes fragile, as if the whole world is nearing its end.'
